  form: `<form class="aods-form" onsubmit="return false">
      <fieldset class="aods-form__section"><legend class="aods-form__legend">Your name</legend>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-fn">First name <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-fn" type="text" autocomplete="given-name"></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-ln">Last name <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-ln" type="text" autocomplete="family-name"></div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="aods-form__section"><legend class="aods-form__legend">Mailing address</legend>
        <p class="aods-form__hint">Where we send the printed permit. Spacing is the grouping: 16px inside this group, 32px to the next.</p>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-a1">Street address <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-a1" type="text" autocomplete="address-line1"></div>
        <label class="aods-checkbox"><input class="aods-checkbox__control" type="checkbox" aria-controls="p-a2-wrap" data-reveal> Add a second address line</label>
        <div class="aods-form__reveal" id="p-a2-wrap" hidden><div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-a2">Address line 2</label><input class="aods-input" id="p-a2" type="text" autocomplete="address-line2"><p class="aods-field__help">Apartment, suite, unit, building, floor.</p></div></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-city">City <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-city" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2"></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-state">State <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><div class="aods-select"><button class="aods-select__trigger" type="button" id="p-state" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="p-state-list" data-placeholder>Select a state</button><ul class="aods-menu aods-select__list" id="p-state-list" role="listbox" hidden><li class="aods-menu__item aods-select__option" role="option" data-value="dc">District of Columbia</li><li class="aods-menu__item aods-select__option" role="option" data-value="md">Maryland</li><li class="aods-menu__item aods-select__option" role="option" data-value="va">Virginia</li></ul><select class="aods-select__native" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><option value="dc">District of Columbia</option><option value="md">Maryland</option><option value="va">Virginia</option></select></div></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-zip">ZIP code <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-zip" type="text" autocomplete="postal-code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{5}(-[0-9]{4})?"></div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="aods-form__section"><legend class="aods-form__legend">Payment</legend>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-cc">Card number <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-cc" type="text" autocomplete="cc-number" inputmode="numeric"></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-exp">Expiration (MM/YY) <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-exp" type="text" autocomplete="cc-exp" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="MM/YY"></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-cvc">Security code <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-cvc" type="text" autocomplete="cc-csc" inputmode="numeric"><p class="aods-field__help">The 3 or 4 digits on the card.</p></div>
        <div class="aods-field"><label class="aods-label" for="p-bzip">Billing ZIP code <span class="aods-label__required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="aods-input" id="p-bzip" type="text" autocomplete="postal-code" inputmode="numeric"><p class="aods-field__help">Card verification asks for ZIP only.</p></div>
      </fieldset>
      <details class="aods-disclosure aods-form__notes" data-density="compact">
        <summary class="aods-disclosure__summary"><span class="aods-disclosure__title">About the questions on this page</span><span class="aods-disclosure__control" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <ul class="aods-disclosure__panel">
          <li class="aods-disclosure__row">Your name must match the name on your government-issued ID.</li>
          <li class="aods-disclosure__row">The mailing address is where the printed permit is sent; it does not have to match your billing address.</li>
          <li class="aods-disclosure__row">We ask only for the billing ZIP code to verify the card. The full billing address is not stored.</li>
          <li class="aods-disclosure__row">Saving and finishing later keeps this page for 30 days.</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
      <div class="aods-form__actions" data-journey><button class="aods-button" data-variant="secondary">Back</button><div class="aods-form__forward"><button class="aods-button" data-variant="tertiary">Save and finish later</button><button class="aods-button" data-variant="primary">Continue</button></div></div>
    </form>
    <p class="cap" style="margin-top:12px">multi-page journey actions: back left · save-and-finish-later + continue right. On the last page Submit takes Continue&rsquo;s place &mdash; never both. A single-page form keeps the plain actions row (submit, then secondary).</p>`,

